{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sd5b3348c89607a08","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-d8dfb2e432710cc0c56c","text":"よく聞くカサ。これは隠されてきた物語で、最も賢い者だけが答えを知ることができる——「浪漫」と「理性」、この二柱のタイタンはどのような関係だったか？","speaker":"匿史虫"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-1b483b17c437e514dca2","text":"創造物と創造主。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-a16587ee738b3b41848d","text":"学生と教師。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-cc4cf3c295405b617d32","text":"友人兼恋人。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-30bb3d2ef64d5bdab06b","text":"上記のすべて。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-e541e8261f63a7107b05","text":"正解！君は小石の下のコケを見つけた——ただし、それを他の人と共有しないように。","speaker":"匿史虫"}]}
